---
<div class="notice">
  <strong>Automatic saving:</strong> Drafts save locally in this browser when storage is available. Open <code>opb.html</code> directly from disk with no server or installation. Because browser-local storage can depend on your browser profile and this file’s location, use <strong>Export JSON Backup</strong> before changing computers, browsers, profiles, or clearing site data.
</div>

<section class="toolbar" aria-label="Document controls">
  <button id="exportBackupBtn" type="button">Export JSON Backup</button>

  <label class="file-label">
    Import JSON Backup
    <input id="importBackupInput" class="sr-only" type="file" accept=".json,application/json">
  </label>

  <button id="exportCsvBtn" type="button">Export CSV</button>

  <label class="file-label">
    Import CSV
    <input id="importCsvInput" class="sr-only" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv">
  </label>

  <button id="printBtn" type="button" class="secondary">Print / Save PDF</button>
  <button id="copyDraftBtn" type="button" class="secondary">Copy Full Draft</button>
  <button id="clearDraftBtn" type="button" class="danger">Clear Draft</button>
</section>

<div id="status" class="status-bar" role="status" aria-live="polite">Initializing offline workspace…</div>
